{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:37 2026-11-21 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉乘飛機被網民集郵  鴨舌帽加黑背包作風低調難掩星味  影帝私下真實反應惹網民熱議\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1fc26139ddbb213cd12841fdf5ffff7/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__108.png\"/>\n<p>影帝梁朝偉近日被網民在飛機上野生捕獲，該名網民在社交平台興奮發文，指自己在飛機上遇上天大喜事，梁朝偉竟然就坐在他隔壁，該網民難掩激動地表示，自己不久前才剛看完梁朝偉的電影《你是不是會當樹嗎》，深受觸動，萬萬沒想到當天就能與偶像近距離並排而坐，驚呼「這機率到底有多低」，一路上他按捺著興奮，直到飛機準備降落時，才終於鼓起勇氣詢問能否合照。當時他緊張到「手都在發抖」，梁朝偉一如既往地毫無架子，大方答應，讓網民狂讚「本人真的很親切」，直呼至今仍覺得一切好不真實，更感激影帝多年來帶來這麼多精彩的好作品。</p>\n<h2>網民遇梁朝偉隨和合照稱不真實</h2>\n<p>從兩人流出的合照中，梁朝偉當日打扮極為低調，戴著深灰色鴨舌帽和太陽眼鏡，身穿一件淺灰色運動外套，肩上孭著背囊，裝扮輕便，與一般旅客無異。面對鏡頭時，梁朝偉面露微笑，神態輕鬆，展現出隨和氣度，梁朝偉親民合照在網上瘋傳，不少網民大讚梁朝偉「超低調飛機 Look」既樸實又有型，更羨慕樓主能與這位殿堂級影帝在萬呎高空共度一趟旅程。</p>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉與劉嘉玲多年來都好恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a286babb2f194422ac15b32440acf754/2024-06/tonyleung_official_1638947978_2724015537966626012_47398690872.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲日前公開照片，獲老公梁朝偉駕車接載的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b28981fe1a1f0ea157bf3cb0ddf0c3d7/2026-08/carinalau1208_1787362490_3969006074427984214_723494209.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉早前被拍到開其超級跑車於石澳飛馳。（Threads@ ahthew_photography） \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f067bcb62ec2526d48d5b646af766c9b/2026-08/1_4_46.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉的保時捷跑車價值逾千萬。（Threads@ tim_9hit_photography） \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/792ad672b7609d344bc08f53916b5091/2026-08/ww1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日梁朝偉與網民合照，被讚親民無架子，深具巨星風範。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/564ed9622bd8f58921d10c93dc7d7c31/2026-11/919523803_17942430156398312_2545227253195225293_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民8月時曾在石澳捕獲梁朝偉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59962f5856d086c50607e3b1c524ebae/2026-09/CAP_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"同一位網民於9月6日再在石澳捕獲梁朝偉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/300e63bd77ed52de5aaeca58f485cea6/2026-09/CAP2_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉坐在開篷保時捷上，看起來心情極佳。（Threads@ tim_9hit_photography）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2fda9613e72ec3f32a011bec99639ae/2026-09/cap3_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"多位網民在同一日捕獲梁朝偉。（IG@ d3vilz_photography）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7c373640b12221c77bccf2df3dae3e4/2026-09/88.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲曾被指介入曾華倩與梁朝偉的戀情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/30af327e0e8dfeb7f73c152573e0c19b/2025-12/sdm02p09230203_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲與梁朝偉拍拖期間，各自都有緋聞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/922bd28b1a9bd30d2c4c5b4329f76779/2025-12/sdma1p08031102.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲曾與多位富商傳緋聞，而梁朝偉也曾傳戀上張曼玉、周迅等女星。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cc0f2a358353b0e95456f8e193e65b66/2025-12/DCENT42107042003.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉與劉嘉玲2008年在不丹結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/964418d17f85a363d0ccfafe0c9908c6/2024-02/_t_4675n_4mb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲早前作客鄭裕玲（Do姐）的YouTube節目《The Do Show》，大談與影帝老公梁朝偉的夫妻相處之道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fd79dd803dcbc51f19aa6fc4bf9d1de/2026-06/VS--YouTube-TheDoShowCarinaLau-22_38_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲在節目中大爆，老公梁朝偉在電影世界外，日常生活中幾乎失去自理能力，大小事都需要她幫忙打點。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50677c2b5830b405544d24306e9fd40c/2026-06/VS--YouTube-TheDoShowCarinaLau-22_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉曾被網民拍到過關時，用「求助」眼神望向老婆劉嘉玲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d7d3f2955decc3d831c1061a4e54e6d/2026-06/VS--YouTube-TheDoShowCarinaLau-22_58_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉早前跟奧斯卡殿堂級影帝羅拔迪尼路「世紀再合照」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2caabf6ae85bd94b91b4b3d495af5d4c/2026-05/177831783673408.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"26年前，梁朝偉跟羅拔迪尼路已識英雄重英雄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ac43479175060b070044d4df342f3e3/2026-05/26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲爆料指梁朝偉看電影要買六張門票，成為網民熱話。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0377462114cb16a543f1dfa642af7d20/2024-01/ad0a9096-9eb9-45d5-86b3-1bce8b751916.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉在內地宣傳時被問到此事，笑笑口說：「沒那麼誇張啦，就買三張而已，就希望旁邊……」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fba7f06c8d958f44392c7408c78b891a/2024-01/tony_5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉曾在毫無預警之下突然進駐抖音。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80ad3d09f621580915534c473af3e439/2023-01/DLPanda_com_7194274891900652857_mp4_snapshot_00_03_858.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"第一段片就講自己有「社恐」癥狀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a89ea76408373e714e8bf109c825c2b3/2023-03/douyin1_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"直指自己見到初次見面的人會緊張，人多時會不知所措。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4643db30b0bd92625a2cb57cb3441388/2023-03/douyin1_21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁朝偉承認有社交恐懼症，親自示範三招克服。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/350bf441df75a2cfcfe46b53b6951b25/2023-02/DLPanda_com_43654985669_7194692272200453434_mp4_snapshot_00_06_741.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"第一招：微笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db1e26a361a36ab26ae452bbcfff30b1/2023-02/DLPanda_com_43654985669_7194692272200453434_mp4_snapshot_00_10_434.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"第二招：揮手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e69f5028b01f3a774eb5f27b9d99832/2023-02/DLPanda_com_43654985669_7194692272200453434_mp4_snapshot_00_16_183.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"第三招：派心心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00ec7b528b21df6529055d184611734e/2023-02/DLPanda_com_43654985669_7194692272200453434_mp4_snapshot_00_23_168.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前梁朝偉與劉嘉玲在日本食店的合照在網上瘋傳，不過全部網民都聚焦在梁朝偉的腳趾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10fb66f92958d3a24f927c426d6d054c/2023-05/346077077_3053603191614346_3287781136941096711_n.jpg\"/>\n<h2>譚詠麟、任達華搭飛機被讚親民</h2>\n<p>事實上，不少乘客在機艙均能捕獲無架子巨星，除了梁朝偉，還有舒淇也是親民代表，曾有空姐爆料指不慎用筆劃到她的手，舒淇非但沒動怒，還溫柔地用不純正廣東話笑說「唔緊要」安慰對方；而高海寧曾經回港時被一眾學生包圍，亦大方融入玩自拍；陳松伶更曾主動開手機電筒，熱心幫隔壁陌生乘客找掉進座椅縫隙的手機。此外，影帝任達華曾被認錯為「楊先生」仍幽默玩梗配合，自稱「我今天是楊先生」，以及「校長」譚詠麟甚至在機上客串「空姐」派毛毯，一眾藝人盡顯貼地親民一面。</p>\n<img alt=\"譚詠麟早前被拍得於飛機上，為搭客服務派毛毯，空姐於後面開心睇實。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/619fa1b0ef3d0575a4e4714e7731a167/2025-11/VS----0_02_-_2025-11-07T144731_832.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚詠麟身為巨星仍然親民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f22bec6872e17bbb23fc541a294462ba/2025-11/VS----0_04_81_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚詠麟好似開心過乘客。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28d4ab9dd0bf018a8e236cbcbd615bf3/2025-11/VS----0_09_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚詠麟好有心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0d81755aefb1eaf769ec4bf08decc61/2025-11/VS----0_14_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲的手開始不規矩，扯住譚詠麟的衣袖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/696150fc7584605f70069d83ef65bbe3/2025-11/VS----0_16_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲更直接掂譚詠麟的手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8add0fa01398008ae5f0fd4f6cdb6bd7/2025-11/VS----0_19_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲雙手捉住譚詠麟的手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0c9c4ad9275686abf3f9841665c2168/2025-11/VS----0_19_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚詠麟不介意和粉絲作身體接觸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/919aa013615cfe3eee4644385e6953f9/2025-11/VS----0_20_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚詠麟的舉動令全機乘客都好開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/658390685b0cb89060cce2bf2fb8675c/2025-11/VS----0_23_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任達華不時四圍飛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c86f8b7666c0aab3215de7a84a30e450/2025-09/YAM_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任達華被空姐不小心將姓氏英文拼音「Yam」讀成「楊先生」，未有發火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df923d0687825066e8c1613a64cccecc/2025-09/YAM_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任達華笑說：「對！我姓楊，我今天姓楊！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f01abe236556c293bd9e2bbcb8e4d164/2025-09/YAM_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"空姐當日指任達華：「一路歡呼動作敏捷爬樓梯到747頭等艙，找到1k快樂坐下！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e91e4a8b248284036935acdb211cb23/2025-09/YAM_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"高海寧玩轉成架飛機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20d7a9a7e478ddc890c9bd1098db31e9/2023-12/50_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"高海寧來者不拒合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ddcefe1d932be547c831e3f7d469dc4/2023-12/51_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"高海寧每張都自拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37860ad8aaaf146db276e171ed0a276c/2023-12/52_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"高海寧還有留言回覆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d16eb1a9e85f5e204a5346cadc6c7299/2023-12/53_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"數十乘客與高海寧合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d296d4b5cf71ea43f3c51562b0514525/2023-12/54_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有搭客向朋友炫耀見到高海寧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1ec722d212e5d16ee951bb94982c112/2023-12/55_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有在大後方的乘客，要指出自己位置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89943097e42b3d60818a8663a4992f48/2023-12/56_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"高海寧笑言人人有份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3dc3d1d5e4cb7327b3b02810f4b22e4/2023-12/57_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"舒淇曾被網民在機艙捕獲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d530c58411c2fcd7138cd7eb9e23ad1/2024-10/ed568ba7-5152-41f7-b625-a04413c8f422.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"素顏的舒淇包到冚，戴帽又戴口罩，低調上機，豈料她一開口說台語即吸引機艙乘客的注意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83330570ff7a463374fccfb54e259dc4/2024-10/890c8dc4-bf00-470f-b9b8-a83209703e7a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"舒淇自己推着一個黑色手提行李及手袋，急步入境香港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7173ed8ca250b7e0df76684bf2807e6d/2024-10/03de086f-0a2c-4f85-b9ad-053dd7a763d2.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:03:58.226221+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":689,"images":53,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T00:13:56.278635+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:27.971190+00:00","content_hash":"20696d7b9921cc687f116361e0ea20e692d8633cbf1fa17f6a945d15bab78534","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}